dotengine/godot/pull/115302.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-26T19:19:58Z"},"body":"Fixes #115238 \r\n\r\nThe `push_multiline` should only be done if there is actually an opening parenthesis. But also, looking at some other parts of the Analyzer, it looks like `push_multiline(true)` should be called before eating the opening parenthesis. So I used the pattern I saw in other places: Check first, then `push_multiline`, then `advance`. \r\n\r\nP.S. It's been a while since I last worked with the GDScript module, hopefully I'm not missing anything important.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115302/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}